{
  "format": "gintama-community-translation-v1",
  "batch_id": "batch_0118",
  "records": [
    {
      "id": "msb_00024C38",
      "source_words_sha256": "af4fdc29667986cb56ec989c763734d237c42ddd8c5ff21678a93b063cf2e330",
      "english": "Look at his Gin Tama!\fNot just the ones\nhe scattered!\nThey're ALL fakes!\fNot ONE Dragon Tama!\fYou damn Amanto con man!",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_00024CDC",
      "source_words_sha256": "32e903e759319299f892c8d01c4b59c4818b2da6755900a2029ea878bf9eea84",
      "english": "What's different?!\fHow will you mend\nmy battered, exhausted,\njagged little heart?!",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_00024DE4",
      "source_words_sha256": "48ff1c84980b73e2159591edbbec8e9d2b095ea9d0055e6cf7162246b4a948f8",
      "english": "Damn! My Dragon Tama!!",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_00024E70",
      "source_words_sha256": "15b3990e628370f3c9f1c1217b27a94689c4ed75480593b2954a5e4da2f37a2b",
      "english": "Yeah, I forged Gin Tama\nand sold 'em to people.\fBut I had ONE...!\fOne real, honest-to-goodness\nrare Tama! Just one!\fWore it round my neck\nlike a lucky charm!",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_00024F44",
      "source_words_sha256": "3ae86ae7318773e402036f89ffa4f721f098fcf90e3095d781ea7709693be9b4",
      "english": "Some bastard\njust stole it!\fWhile I was running from you,\nsomeone jumped\nout of the dark...\fBefore I knew it...\fI wanted to chase 'em,\nbut you'd catch me\nif I hung around...\fHad to let it go!\nWhat'll you do about that?!",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0002507C",
      "source_words_sha256": "462583b3dcb88b16d40faaa68f7f9ab76ba8e729a303a6742367f41d2ad59aef",
      "english": "Glad you asked!\fI wanted to dream\none more time!\fI was rolling in dough.\nThought I could do anything!\f...Then... back then...",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_00025130",
      "source_words_sha256": "b3252773611192a00ef8e61d463d95497b78886fab6d7d16af1f47a9ee9c4d90",
      "english": "I had this new venture:\na high-leg leotard\nshabu-shabu joint...\fSo close to\nopening up...\fThen some punk interfered,\nand the cops\nhauled me in...\fSpent every last sen\ngetting released!\nEverything ruined!\fAll because of\nthat lousy punk!\fTo make a comeback,\nI couldn't be picky.\nEven shady stuff was fair!\fI made up my mind...\fI wasn't gonna\ndie like this!\fThen I hit on\na comeback plan!",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0002532C",
      "source_words_sha256": "a195f8e4b0f4d5a2ad4aadb46d7a570d4c4afc4c6a6e78106e8d7a93acd7f192",
      "english": "A maid casino!\nIt'll be a hit!\nWe'll make a fortune!\f...Well? Want in?",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_00025390",
      "source_words_sha256": "b5e314aefd0b2065f156cf8ccf8ae045b3ee8ebc337ad8b629c8ee34e6468a4e",
      "english": "...So, I needed\nsome startup cash.\fJust earning a little\nfor expenses, see?\fI used the Gin Tama craze.\nEspecially those\nDragon Tama rumors.\fSwiped Gin Tama all over\nand painted 'em gold...",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_00025B40",
      "source_words_sha256": "3c0349e04a27cfd0c566b055cfc8a9c69c5c4c09aca9aa167048346dfddc006b",
      "english": "Why a brazier...?",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_00025B94",
      "source_words_sha256": "cd0915184d1b1d34d25c9da4da76994d37579c8cb788c3f2c5b8c304d4aac1e0",
      "english": "Sorry...\fRather toss it in a gutter\nthan give it to you, Hijikata.",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_00025BF8",
      "source_words_sha256": "97d5100f41fcba24536ee8cc0967ffe5659ae49fbea370199474b84532e6b5c4",
      "english": "Just curious...\nVice Chief, got any Gin Tama?",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_00025C48",
      "source_words_sha256": "dc736cd8f2e68992f984f85b443f8a7b81e95c0fe8fb92ed2b211b5c8be0a1a3",
      "english": "No Gin Tama?\nWhat'll you do in battle?",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_00025DB8",
      "source_words_sha256": "15714df675dcafaef2233e39fc4a7a43f3c9d84755ccb8193aeb65a04a73c3ae",
      "english": "Check the brazier\nin the corner.\nI'll leave the info there.",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_00025ED8",
      "source_words_sha256": "fabbef0ea94c4a6542c3d27183cf8b4f2702c4d587c1f8e622525f384b780374",
      "english": "A dirty place for a deal?",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_00025F44",
      "source_words_sha256": "e2d1515cb4ce4e4f88c5c27db16736b0c6f81442474ad4457aa37fa3012dc933",
      "english": "Hey, Yorozuya boss.\nWhat brings you out so late?",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_000260A0",
      "source_words_sha256": "cd28df834d61855138efe4a24530d58faf6ae97a2e48efe78eabacfee54beac3",
      "english": "For toilets, only\n[blue]South Park St.[/color]\nis open now...\fThat place sounds\npretty suspicious, right?",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_00026160",
      "source_words_sha256": "ae92989cd159186e7354ec4cbf4cfbffee132124cb12aba4730d70c46f24d82e",
      "english": "Y-you've gotta run...\fMake a break for it,\nas they say.\fGood luck.\nDon't die out there.",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_00026220",
      "source_words_sha256": "93d6c7bcec874531e14a865c802f0aa66bc533da1730406915dcc04827e48970",
      "english": "I spent this month's\nliving money on Gin Tama.\nToo scared to go home...\fMy wife's as scary\nas Otae at\n[blue]Kodokan Dojo[/color]!",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0002630C",
      "source_words_sha256": "7e56074a7a21609219aca3c9add56a1d8d7e371c991e97fbcc5a0ea23bf4bd33",
      "english": "Oh, the blocked path\nin [blue]Hedoro's Forest[/color].\fWe can finally get\nto [blue]Golden St.[/color] now.",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_000263B8",
      "source_words_sha256": "59f8a21b9f777477eb7ddb2e858f23faabb5ae7f78c0a724544821534073a1fe",
      "english": "Work on [blue]South Park St.[/color]\nis finally done.",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_000263EC",
      "source_words_sha256": "beb4644906fa073ce354177164496cc73ddc2079564bb0e9836eab5e2a021abb",
      "english": "Oh, right...\fDon't overdo it on\n[blue]Golden St.[/color] after so long.\nPush it too far and...",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_00026458",
      "source_words_sha256": "ed56df8260dc9ef25f534658f87700379be8297a466104d74f5e1da702fbc9f6",
      "english": "Bad for your health.",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_00026534",
      "source_words_sha256": "ece09aab64c9c101944c82fbde557d36fd31f77346a1725bbd284dbf8e8ea394",
      "english": "What?\fWhat happened to finding\nthat broker and getting rich?",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_00026574",
      "source_words_sha256": "31511a7613e9e9e9f9693f909f07f22b68dad15448e7fd0754769af8266cc3a3",
      "english": "You carefree perm-head!!\fUse your feet and your brain\nto find information!\nGet out and WORK, damn it!!",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_000266F0",
      "source_words_sha256": "29f02a5d119e77307051a2b9baf9fa374ebdd27ef452582c691dc6d2a40cc062",
      "english": "Getting tired\nby now, aren't you?",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_00026890",
      "source_words_sha256": "c0e28b09c89cff3ffb78356775070fb4d9a8e22f392225b53ebf2deef52cc431",
      "english": "That's about as subtle\nas a blazing fastball.",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_000269C0",
      "source_words_sha256": "f1eafdc006eab5e9c246d56fad35c785ac93f454609d10bb7c4581f599b69cbb",
      "english": "Gave me this pleading look,\nthen wandered off\ntoward the [blue]Forest Trail[/color].",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_00026BCC",
      "source_words_sha256": "25e0285a51e624a60a9eafa309bdef38a8cc2e0e86e3dadf68284e600b4e9ffe",
      "english": "Don't know. I prefer\ngolden castella to Gin Tama.",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_00026CD4",
      "source_words_sha256": "678b8a6e46d8297f70b4aefc2929d3c1af88743d33d48aedd481905ae7082a0f",
      "english": "How insolent!\nGet out of my sight!",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_00026EB8",
      "source_words_sha256": "489dace41a878e54cb955cacd33c4c7e14a13d373d2c0ea8c773ccbd41e033c4",
      "english": "Huh? Are you blushing?",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_00026F0C",
      "source_words_sha256": "e5fe5c1c29d212220ca77ee40ca4a6e8a782edfab95cbd49a9a2084a65fe45f7",
      "english": "............\fRight. I'll quietly\nbe on my way...",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_00027164",
      "source_words_sha256": "673b096c5c57c18b774ed4c83280eeb06678cf5543d18144c63480ad60e24100",
      "english": "Paid in goods?\nGive me CASH!",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0002718C",
      "source_words_sha256": "9d102c626bf7e8a1ea9cfc664bffad960b1052d2eab914dea0d577bd999e97d9",
      "english": "Cash, and\nI'll think about it.",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_00027374",
      "source_words_sha256": "2e2a5080ef06080e3f4793bbfea614a2bba674625e8489b097e9ea7e37fb3f9e",
      "english": "Even an idiot\nhas a strategy.\nUnderestimate him and lose.",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_000273C8",
      "source_words_sha256": "14f21de78c00d3ff4e8b6bd03e6c05a8b04687e9d21e4ed8ecc28545986ec52c",
      "english": "Then stop it,\nyou spoiled old man.",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_00027414",
      "source_words_sha256": "28689c61c614263ba2d339e9ec32a9ed63ce6cd112d2bd96e468306f9128c397",
      "english": "Don't drink yourself sick.\nYour grandkid'll be sad.",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0002753C",
      "source_words_sha256": "4b271bac379f745fa74322711f136692da92eb78e1e19d0b35887d38673c5e77",
      "english": "Fine dining every night's tiring.",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0002755C",
      "source_words_sha256": "5f6696efae080f3759b094b31770fc45a5cf4906921800720037113017052296",
      "english": "Can't do that.\nThe rich must dine in style.\nSociety's rules.",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_000275A8",
      "source_words_sha256": "1a254dfc6bd1f4fafe9c57b1bb3e4c25815e4f178d928f42ffbe3bb4adf838ca",
      "english": "Ugh... My liver...",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_00027604",
      "source_words_sha256": "99d855e51088480cfde8a9385fe9ee83e800ea688a07beaf18e3203b0e1b19b2",
      "english": "Booze means a long life.\nI'll keep dining out.",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_00027EB4",
      "source_words_sha256": "496ff0fcf21e07c88ff46bf0547b14e8d5e26fa8df2f67b46cfa6ae84907aa66",
      "english": "Through [blue]South Park St.[/color],\nthen right for Golden St.\fOn [blue]South Golden St.[/color],\nthere's [blue]Snack Smile[/color]...\f[blue]North Golden St.[/color] has\n[blue]Kamakko Club[/color] and\nthe [blue]Kunoichi Cafe[/color].",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0002817C",
      "source_words_sha256": "2cb7b63fc09ef715f99b885a26d4f6ff9daef5c9b38db9311648df728f70b83a",
      "english": "Yeah... Looking around,\nthen into [blue]Forest Trail[/color].",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0002833C",
      "source_words_sha256": "d92b6c6d1851fce1873c5bea6e26af3a92c95a836133c304c133dd36e1ce9a1d",
      "english": "What? A filthy place now?!\n............\fHmph! All of Oedo\nlooks filthy to me...",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_00028718",
      "source_words_sha256": "27eb70ffc762edfaeaa6bdb4942960f2d7cda118418fb8a8d2fbe14e0fade4e8",
      "english": "Oh! Wrong conversion!\nGave me a start.",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_00028834",
      "source_words_sha256": "d8bad9b4da123ce8b1285a6e6d23ce3cbe21bc56dc08d1ad1e8544f3145998a5",
      "english": "[blue]South Golden St.[/color]?\nIt's gotta be [blue]Snack Smile[/color]...\fRight, pal?\nYou agree, don't you?!",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_00028A4C",
      "source_words_sha256": "f4a72c2c2f99172991ae442a062ecd11d6de1e1e0b0646ac208b2a861615f0df",
      "english": "Oh, Gin! Been ages!",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_00028B18",
      "source_words_sha256": "6eab6624b9593ff4425a002ad1129c88b23c6f40afe02ee577de4eb2c2649a1f",
      "english": "Quiet today.\nCalm before the storm?\n...Nah.",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_00028B58",
      "source_words_sha256": "744c5b04834dbe4609debc2ed60c5b0bae68082404819b3f5812012d6d2d9799",
      "english": "Here it comes! The storm!\nThose old sayings\nwere right!",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_00028C28",
      "source_words_sha256": "244ca2a990541394c38a3b70c23f128f88ef545cd2ed9bfc4d27c9612d9959ff",
      "english": "On [blue]North Golden St.[/color],\nI recommend [blue]Kamakko Club[/color].\fWorth seeing at least once!\fThough they say\nonce is quite enough...",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_00028CB4",
      "source_words_sha256": "7dc3b5fa5e4a9d624da6cf4ebc79c251012f43ea7fac6ee0b055ad526557d6fa",
      "english": "Well, Paako! Been ages!",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_00028E00",
      "source_words_sha256": "acbcce331b2e06838459c4bf212d846303d22b0e25e3bfd4457bd06b507724cb",
      "english": "No drinking, no dancing...\nWhy do Amanto customers\neven come here lately?",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_00028E90",
      "source_words_sha256": "c95cd49ed85b9e152e40e08b8da1338c4f440c51bda15e0843936d481bc21406",
      "english": "You're cute as Paako,\nbut I prefer you as Gin.\nI LOVE you!",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_00028EE0",
      "source_words_sha256": "c2054029d32a7bb40cbee439b1a41b03393baaf2c65e6fa36c70aa5764c9fc38",
      "english": "Gin! Hurt? You okay?\n............\nMy fists will avenge you!!",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_00029028",
      "source_words_sha256": "e3277d1f0da8ca0d764439260396ad34b6cbcdddf9a17e0b155fb7b24ac4d459",
      "english": "This [blue]Forest Trail[/color]\nmust be cursed.\nKappas, shambling zombies...",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_000290B4",
      "source_words_sha256": "fee898ce75546466d04393dae1553064c8dd733f3521c79cb6bef3c016fb03e3",
      "english": "Unlucky, huh...?\fMind your own business!!",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_000290EC",
      "source_words_sha256": "66718c048bbce5936c317bd38a97d9f51853bf25284b914d04eae9e079d07394",
      "english": "Yeah. Someone\nlooking like a zombie\nstaggered toward [blue]Kodokan Dojo[/color].",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_000291B4",
      "source_words_sha256": "34370aa48c4b4a6149b04ba3aa177ae2fe8b1867a9a1099fc328bb9de9745b2e",
      "english": "Maybe happiness...",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_00029240",
      "source_words_sha256": "868877afba21d77092e90215c525a3d77437e55042b438b6e2769d5ea446d96e",
      "english": "A [blue]pond[/color] deep in this\n[blue]Forest Trail[/color]?\nNot worth much.",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0002936C",
      "source_words_sha256": "665cfe711a0271c15fd928dc75f7bcf894e2d13a0f975ebed917931f28fb8505",
      "english": "For weak foes, brute force\nor a weakness Kotodama\nwill do...\fNot so with\nexperienced opponents.\fCheck your Gin Tama\nfor useful Effect Tama\nwhen that happens...\fWatch their attack habits\nand turn them\nto your advantage...\fLanding your own strategy\nfeels pretty good!",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_000294D8",
      "source_words_sha256": "c41e6ee14583d24856989dd3388120deaac2455023cb3db26e52e2d003ede52b",
      "english": "Be extra careful\nagainst multiple foes.\fUse all-target Gin Tama\nand defend wisely\nto get through it.",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0002976C",
      "source_words_sha256": "02bda645b799f34c38c7efef2b2a62aeb6022cf6c695783393fcbe0030a3917b",
      "english": "Ah!!\fSuddenly I'm full!!\nYep, I'm fine now!\nTotally fine. Yep.",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_000298E4",
      "source_words_sha256": "2c52f07fb43e5330890ec68f68ce304d8e20ac3d74e12d25aef38c0555e9aff2",
      "english": "You lot feed on lost kids?!",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_00029944",
      "source_words_sha256": "f56c31b4be73c2114662fa4507cc1e56b4d9ae5d3b5c39044cc2abbc0edfffe1",
      "english": "Hey...\fKnow any filthy places?",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_00029A2C",
      "source_words_sha256": "adf35eae16b3e88ce053035a4c3f03196b5699abda7c35e8cf41fbf83d02562c",
      "english": "Filthy places, huh...\fA manga magazine\neditorial office...",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_00029A70",
      "source_words_sha256": "85527839a43b2fcdbf5dbe041ad3a86ad8339f379eec45b052b03ded1457fe78",
      "english": "A game development office...\fOr a toilet, I guess?",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_00029AA8",
      "source_words_sha256": "b4bf9a773642cd8645b7f04bf2052d76019d4eee245b350ec06fde1d9877f78b",
      "english": "Hm? A pale Amanto\nfled [blue]South Golden St.[/color]?\fWouldn't come this far.\nLook somewhere\ncloser, why don't you?",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_00029B8C",
      "source_words_sha256": "e7217f7444700b6ade43ba3efef8688d7ac7e7dc2731919beda460333e212ccc",
      "english": "An anime studio...",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_00029BAC",
      "source_words_sha256": "09f93c9a613256f508116f987620440bcf9ab1c33e47300c5a927d3e93750fde",
      "english": "Obviously, it's dark\nat night. Lots of things\nare hard to see.\fEasy to miss fallen\nGin Tama, so\nkeep your eyes peeled...",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_00029C3C",
      "source_words_sha256": "3a57be306961e317dca30dcc6e7e971da116c28ca51d5b4bb9f1ebd949555b66",
      "english": "Don't wander at night.\nThought you were a monster.",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_00029D58",
      "source_words_sha256": "82ca5fefafbfaeb04f9437ac87f27399092387346e04f346a7d0be84f1036c92",
      "english": "An old lady's greeting\ndoesn't thrill me...",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_00029D8C",
      "source_words_sha256": "15aa0af765df8ffddec26a76ce0d9874a8933903d33d66506d9a385207960b94",
      "english": "How many centuries ago...?",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_00029EF0",
      "source_words_sha256": "3c9c4900be506b13f1c34eb6019d6afe0ba2ed9fba7a8dc65e72782f2eb97f53",
      "english": "Sorry. Please come\nback another day.",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0002A30C",
      "source_words_sha256": "74f523442455dcf404ae45340747b3a81484d2a99612efab7593c369c973397b",
      "english": "Hope it doesn't\nlast till morning...",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0002A438",
      "source_words_sha256": "e38a4cee282eef390356126f71e06e1ca5d15f73124bfcfd052838ce0b781ade",
      "english": "Don't know!\nYou're in the way. Scram!",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0002A7B4",
      "source_words_sha256": "6ef5ac50b4044af21405febc23a9b981f122839fd6eaad5c23445a66a4702ffb",
      "english": "First I'll make headlines\nby getting caught cheating.",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0002A91C",
      "source_words_sha256": "2404265f9a1b68e8f12904e583e3d58fcbd87af60a4cc53f344171f5f1146e6c",
      "english": "Up all night\nwith Gin Tama...?",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0002AA68",
      "source_words_sha256": "1a0e71b7ea7d6778a82d4727c0958c5e2e9814170b58a7677026c7f1414bf426",
      "english": "Yep. Going with an HG look\nthis time. Look forward to it.",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0002AB0C",
      "source_words_sha256": "ca6837983e21ba72e230d3222eb95a7b7aac48e95dbefea67d85b25187e4e111",
      "english": "Kitajima Goro's popularity\nmight beat mine lately.",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0002AC6C",
      "source_words_sha256": "75f287c6e531fe742f955a6ebf367ed76a125197b6a6742c7654945b1be3ffec",
      "english": "Searched past\n[blue]Dango Shop St.[/color] yet?",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0002B0EC",
      "source_words_sha256": "6dfb76ce9517b5042c2bfb17b629b628f932e66d8c2cf41f4d2c8dafe8f09822",
      "english": "I spent this month's\nliving money on Gin Tama.\nToo scared to go home...\fMy wife's as scary\nas Otae at\n[blue]Kodokan Dojo[/color]...",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0002B3CC",
      "source_words_sha256": "c478ade91a777773d5b007153bcac782a60bdfca0126f5c929c386eadfa536cf",
      "english": "No, I don't have it.\nRare Tama\naren't easy to get.",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0002B51C",
      "source_words_sha256": "7fc27f17c4d880e3c42f239123b1b079cf9eb875570a592119543364227ba82b",
      "english": "Don't know. If I saw one,\nI'd film it\nwith this camera.",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0002B62C",
      "source_words_sha256": "cb79cba684439c2c76fc9b072d6b1391154f146137bd1011b038e82e76d6cd1d",
      "english": "No idea. But pork\nstir-fried with kimchi?\nThat's delicious!",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0002B728",
      "source_words_sha256": "99611413ab84bf4d88670956f74de38025a0bc2051513134c1534c485cd612c5",
      "english": "Ask the police.",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0002B788",
      "source_words_sha256": "58801be8c4fff05990359ff7ee5b42211abc85f02e62d49db8a1f55c740245fd",
      "english": "Then report them missing.",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0002B9DC",
      "source_words_sha256": "f8bbec85377c2afc7e65ac607eb29c13add7b5d2510a3ff7ff9ebb45f45bf128",
      "english": "It's midnight.\nKeep it down.",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0002BA8C",
      "source_words_sha256": "07d281db473882b739a673216fe2af8fa7a9f12790b13a146f7eed00eabefb97",
      "english": "Are you HAPPYYY?!\nDREAM CATCHER!!",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0002BC74",
      "source_words_sha256": "a98f57cbb3c2edb163ba01221b56f4e76ba20a6af8f90027f118b0b31924a159",
      "english": "Alien vs. Yakuza!",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0002BE4C",
      "source_words_sha256": "03b1ea928e9e6775871b92d299f4e35ed1dc878de374dc8699046faa4a76ad11",
      "english": "I see... Sorry to bother you.",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0002BE80",
      "source_words_sha256": "3b8f3c93b3848f62528c27913dacf53d03078909104c91a4b63bb1b08654e20a",
      "english": "Oh, Shinsengumi.\nNeed something?",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0002C06C",
      "source_words_sha256": "2404265f9a1b68e8f12904e583e3d58fcbd87af60a4cc53f344171f5f1146e6c",
      "english": "Up all night\nwith Gin Tama...?",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0002C0FC",
      "source_words_sha256": "09f93c9a613256f508116f987620440bcf9ab1c33e47300c5a927d3e93750fde",
      "english": "Obviously, it's dark\nat night. Lots of things\nare hard to see.\fEasy to miss fallen\nGin Tama, so\nkeep your eyes peeled...",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0002C7E8",
      "source_words_sha256": "c41e6ee14583d24856989dd3388120deaac2455023cb3db26e52e2d003ede52b",
      "english": "Be extra careful\nagainst multiple foes.\fUse all-target Gin Tama\nand defend wisely\nto get through it.",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0002C954",
      "source_words_sha256": "198c9ebe46873ac6438b7dc19cdc0275484a501ab201cd297f03b821c51aadc3",
      "english": "Try [blue]Koei Theater[/color].",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0002CB44",
      "source_words_sha256": "26efd7f625928626a29ca84ec01495770c59fb9440b15108c316c452f00d5f94",
      "english": "Got it.\nA reward. Take it!",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0002CDD8",
      "source_words_sha256": "2e2a5080ef06080e3f4793bbfea614a2bba674625e8489b097e9ea7e37fb3f9e",
      "english": "Even an idiot\nhas a strategy.\nUnderestimate him and lose.",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0002CE2C",
      "source_words_sha256": "4b271bac379f745fa74322711f136692da92eb78e1e19d0b35887d38673c5e77",
      "english": "Fine dining every night's tiring.",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0002CE4C",
      "source_words_sha256": "176271f9323ad9f07be747ee25afb3657372117a0bac6b37ea7d9ad94dc3c75c",
      "english": "No idea.\fUgh... My liver...",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0002CEB8",
      "source_words_sha256": "3f0e785ec87533923198e70b8038485c4214054e6e25142696f0bab95883546b",
      "english": "Oh, would you like\nthis Gin Tama?",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0002CF2C",
      "source_words_sha256": "85f39b1afa2ce480a6a760f46e831de368cb36f88535433b4c4dc66b2bbd5132",
      "english": "Booze means a long life.\nI'll keep dining out.",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0002CF8C",
      "source_words_sha256": "98d021e07d6f5ae2199cc18c55b61f106ccb9a44c206548bfbc475bf3e96cb2f",
      "english": "Great sales!\nTomorrow too!",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0002D020",
      "source_words_sha256": "9bc3aea7881714924cf44d462378b1f1bc8b8a958798073723aca735db42ca5f",
      "english": "Don't drink yourself sick.\nYour family's worried.",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0002D04C",
      "source_words_sha256": "36b533783839efb01bc1217b490739f6229924567326ce7f639079c2961d5ce8",
      "english": "Then watch your health.",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0002D138",
      "source_words_sha256": "1a63800244a6c799369b6c03f7c31cee605c32b8a126ec1710984e76ac39dfe7",
      "english": "Can't let that slide...",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0002D1FC",
      "source_words_sha256": "d068c7a87e64ca2b0098fa500c42ebd2d10357f8b47bb98140d9b494ce888f03",
      "english": "I'll arrest you. Seriously!",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0002D230",
      "source_words_sha256": "25e0285a51e624a60a9eafa309bdef38a8cc2e0e86e3dadf68284e600b4e9ffe",
      "english": "Don't know. I prefer\ngolden castella to Gin Tama.",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0002D268",
      "source_words_sha256": "4098e02644a9c852644d34a1103f37e59231c7de2155d7bd5251771230ea1a51",
      "english": "Oops... Slipped out...\nNo, just kidding. Kidding!",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0002D308",
      "source_words_sha256": "496ff0fcf21e07c88ff46bf0547b14e8d5e26fa8df2f67b46cfa6ae84907aa66",
      "english": "Through [blue]South Park St.[/color],\nthen right for Golden St.\fOn [blue]South Golden St.[/color],\nthere's [blue]Snack Smile[/color]...\f[blue]North Golden St.[/color] has\n[blue]Kamakko Club[/color] and\nthe [blue]Kunoichi Cafe[/color].",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0002D46C",
      "source_words_sha256": "3f317c6a652ea9c42c2ac6c2695cb092995ccb12be6625bb1483b0423f985735",
      "english": "Seen no one tonight.\fTook a walk toward\n[blue]Saguri Bridge[/color].\nNobody there.",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0002D4C8",
      "source_words_sha256": "c1d16120857828c5a6df7670f1ab55e6b7699f16d77a9ed470652f731955ef59",
      "english": "You again?\nStay for a drink?",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0002D548",
      "source_words_sha256": "26238301f79744e649dcd23a1a32158b816dd415b84980c12a8bf6ec0ae0fb34",
      "english": "The lodgers upstairs are out.",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0002D5C4",
      "source_words_sha256": "b6f083cf9bbb8fce816be77f9888183e64145d5fceb4b21b1b99b08c64c5a467",
      "english": "All that back-and-forth.\nNot tired?",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0002D6D0",
      "source_words_sha256": "cff934259351c1105be6b1807cd5aacbf213dc1de6e4686d683edfe5043b5318",
      "english": "D-don't wander at night.\nThought you were a monster!",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0002D7EC",
      "source_words_sha256": "3bae5dae0ef9d8d3064d69fb3271086826ccbea477e2070775b693ea396bcbee",
      "english": "How many centuries ago...?\nJust go home and sleep.",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0002DB90",
      "source_words_sha256": "854be327c7bd8a40f09d5e74f5ad5fb7fbe5f242d95881f303290ef3bddce3a1",
      "english": "Quit that creepy chant!\nWe don't need\nthat weird kind of help!",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0002DC04",
      "source_words_sha256": "d8bad9b4da123ce8b1285a6e6d23ce3cbe21bc56dc08d1ad1e8544f3145998a5",
      "english": "[blue]South Golden St.[/color]?\nIt's gotta be [blue]Snack Smile[/color]...\fRight, pal?\nYou agree, don't you?!",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0002DC74",
      "source_words_sha256": "755b6bb413296f405ef7d386ac5a1d21a811071860c1d48d97e17446cae14db7",
      "english": "Oh, Hijikata! Been ages!",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0002DCDC",
      "source_words_sha256": "e3d80796bb9b6028a99d893f6599e1e9f793d01dd6548a1321cf1e1e49d6efa2",
      "english": "How unusual.\nThe Shinsengumi visiting...",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0002DD40",
      "source_words_sha256": "6eab6624b9593ff4425a002ad1129c88b23c6f40afe02ee577de4eb2c2649a1f",
      "english": "Quiet today.\nCalm before the storm?\n...Nah.",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0002DD80",
      "source_words_sha256": "744c5b04834dbe4609debc2ed60c5b0bae68082404819b3f5812012d6d2d9799",
      "english": "Here it comes! The storm!\nThose old sayings\nwere right!",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0002DDC8",
      "source_words_sha256": "d172834ee230fee19689b79dd255b29e3b60da2b96757c4c419b6a5d66c5c91a",
      "english": "More Amanto\ncustomers lately.\nGood for business, but...",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0002DE4C",
      "source_words_sha256": "244ca2a990541394c38a3b70c23f128f88ef545cd2ed9bfc4d27c9612d9959ff",
      "english": "On [blue]North Golden St.[/color],\nI recommend [blue]Kamakko Club[/color].\fWorth seeing at least once!\fThough they say\nonce is quite enough...",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0002DED8",
      "source_words_sha256": "5e1bbae74faea97b77cc22d5c6ef86ebbb05397761041b85b4522fdda07be81b",
      "english": "Well, gentlemen! Been ages!",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0002DFC4",
      "source_words_sha256": "acbcce331b2e06838459c4bf212d846303d22b0e25e3bfd4457bd06b507724cb",
      "english": "No drinking, no dancing...\nWhy do Amanto customers\neven come here lately?",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0002E054",
      "source_words_sha256": "af14ebf65088d5e51f0ffa4d3aa07cc228b887b6b316b14763af357ffd03e231",
      "english": "Oh, handsome...\nHow about we...\fArm-wrestle?",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0002E0BC",
      "source_words_sha256": "147a70429761fd4bc04118f8c981fcabe99a9a6ea153504355ba0848e14119f7",
      "english": "I eat way too much sugar!\nYou really\nshouldn't do that!!",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0002E2DC",
      "source_words_sha256": "53e4d892501d8566a83522a9a02394b252c816920eb342d1dec2c98fad6ec302",
      "english": "[blue]South Park St.[/color] [blue]WC[/color]",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0002E300",
      "source_words_sha256": "d28df6edb2b427df3b16132d0dea63e5df378ae8dee0238e6ced3803b3bae647",
      "english": "Filthy.",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0002E324",
      "source_words_sha256": "496619de4987cbbb5abc3920f1f2a6d54ee4642db52a7e95b6215b3c233ebc4f",
      "english": "[ctrl:FFA3]What?\nSame as always.",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0002E350",
      "source_words_sha256": "694f60211c1bc5d48191b7338a88d5d36a8e6b3fa85f7f96a5673c004001b798",
      "english": "[ctrl:FFA3]What time is it?",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0002E364",
      "source_words_sha256": "61ced1632a3a77a5dfa47284bb37ecb8c909afa57cfa68d6ef45f69fca5a0ce5",
      "english": "[ctrl:FFA2]WHAAAT?!\nSeven already?!",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0002E38C",
      "source_words_sha256": "b7eb0c8bf76ed4373ff165a9714daf95beb0acae67ac91c4a90a7ef9903d1aee",
      "english": "[ctrl:FFA2]I missed\nthe afternoon drama rerun!",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0002E3C0",
      "source_words_sha256": "0211cf340caf821bf9b7ecfc3d7c77de1dc146019e488f0516985a4978599bce",
      "english": "[ctrl:FFA3]That's exactly the problem.\f[ctrl:FFA3]Feels lousy when\nyour routine's disrupted.",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0002E40C",
      "source_words_sha256": "0e83d14ec9a95c6db6177bf73da0826f771f21ed6d47edb6c3c25cde45aacb37",
      "english": "[ctrl:FFA3]I'm a kid at heart.",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0002E424",
      "source_words_sha256": "9ef08e0a9157bb041a8380fe8105c962a9e87d1b91e0261f83ec2d34dee7b4a5",
      "english": "[ctrl:FFA3]What's for dinner?",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0002E444",
      "source_words_sha256": "e6bca93df1e52335288fc8b8167d5d22e9c810ec510a49c6dc5a42a401206cb9",
      "english": "[ctrl:FFA3]Huh? Why?",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0002E454",
      "source_words_sha256": "983f5fbd05574a52082882f89dcab50a90463eddf89c8e29c97263cce1cc1e80",
      "english": "[ctrl:FFA3]Why?",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0002E464",
      "source_words_sha256": "4ec79f3c5aa7d9e013d989e597a2d675e8b81821b15271209059f5dcb9511a25",
      "english": "[ctrl:FFA3]Harder to find than I thought.",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0002E488",
      "source_words_sha256": "b0818137c5cc63dc750602477c81255742fdff80e3fe33a6701dd948496036bb",
      "english": "[ctrl:FFA3]Hope animal control\nhasn't caught him.",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0002E4B4",
      "source_words_sha256": "ab39af815776866a8c95bd8c9a9034e5b70e75969720c0c8234c0a0a9397d126",
      "english": "[ctrl:FFA3]What?",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0002E4C4",
      "source_words_sha256": "5bfc4025b865e8d134ddae7ec4775d8615a1e8bc121f4f68c083eff3d160e2a3",
      "english": "[ctrl:FFA3]She'll just yell at us.",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0002E4E8",
      "source_words_sha256": "0565f1adb9460665f283e298b8ff3cd16b263da5a116cace1e69ab258605a2ce",
      "english": "[ctrl:FFA3]A job lead, huh...\nNot feeling it.",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0002E51C",
      "source_words_sha256": "ba25f25733d09760f649f55815166ec9a1ebce81dc8606c82df006e9cceb0bd6",
      "english": "[ctrl:FFA3]Huh? Why?",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0002E530",
      "source_words_sha256": "e573aa2645c887a1d53c10641553feadabbe2fbefa234a01ef88db4e6d5f2cc8",
      "english": "[ctrl:FFA3]If Kagura insists,\nlet's go.",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0002E558",
      "source_words_sha256": "c2d648926b5a506552664948b4b082fe52b13438cc7f89e8b2c21abae3e324ea",
      "english": "[ctrl:FFA3]Looks aside,\nshe's got heart.",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0002E580",
      "source_words_sha256": "6532afd17e301e428d1b08b08d618973b1e7eca11012c04ad4d3af5889030a51",
      "english": "[ctrl:FFA3]I'm hungry...",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0002E5A4",
      "source_words_sha256": "7c379c7c3f82e7cfc210d11ec2c288f14c8af552b2c918ae14d7a839eb71b4aa",
      "english": "[ctrl:FFA2]Missed Ladies 4 too!",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0002E5C4",
      "source_words_sha256": "fb586e9121295ace1d9dfbff898753d4e4091b339b6303fc9a26d868ecd9a639",
      "english": "[ctrl:FFA2]Right!\nJust like Gin said.",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0002E5EC",
      "source_words_sha256": "fa8012dd15540e86a417cf4846ac1300d6ea305857e9847d2cedd9776099ffb9",
      "english": "[ctrl:FFA2]I'm not an adult.",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0002E604",
      "source_words_sha256": "fdc985b4653977650c48b0f56acf8c7256b72050dea9291c500c40b400896952",
      "english": "[ctrl:FFA2]Just make dinner\nalready, Shinpachi.",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0002E62C",
      "source_words_sha256": "f78ec735ed0dd6c36aa0556597780d6fc43616e9c87ebb038d60e3e6a5b209fb",
      "english": "[ctrl:FFA2]Busy hunting Gin Tama.",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0002E654",
      "source_words_sha256": "8fb264a31d39244c2ccdb8ad198c67bc59638883bc8c34c0508a187e2e98fa4b",
      "english": "[ctrl:FFA3]Sadaharu went Tama-hunting\nand still isn't back.",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0002E68C",
      "source_words_sha256": "94eb728e944514d34b39c3076f7fa978598f0974ef82371259f28a8b52171d95",
      "english": "[ctrl:FFA2]Go see Otose?",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0002E6B0",
      "source_words_sha256": "7461a1a1ee0894cf2691fa247e1191d5dd191c4a0c38c310de1055224342bb08",
      "english": "[ctrl:FFA2]Ask her, yes?",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0002E6C8",
      "source_words_sha256": "6cd0cf07cd26903439ca6903d0819fdcc39effbd15dcf03dc056d6fd8c0300ba",
      "english": "[ctrl:FFA2]Ask her over\na free dinner.",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0002E6EC",
      "source_words_sha256": "90886af56ba86ef9aa67c196f58fc6289b025a73a9183779c7fe48b373ccb96b",
      "english": "[ctrl:FFA2]Let's go!",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0002E704",
      "source_words_sha256": "543893a1d0521d57a94b496c92a1d373ddffa90426d6e836a95f72d91e29ac55",
      "english": "[ctrl:FFA2]Come on! Let's go!",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0002E720",
      "source_words_sha256": "6ae5dfbf86202e422255164d7ddf2851f4ceed361173b04a6a20920ec72d87c6",
      "english": "[ctrl:FFA3]Gin, no work\nagain today, huh?",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0002E748",
      "source_words_sha256": "716925a1b1ae57781f52013bf17b9be8ddf6335c59e285ebb0c0040bc06baed5",
      "english": "[ctrl:FFA3]It's seven at night.",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0002E760",
      "source_words_sha256": "ad5a0f3f0668fa280a40c2cf2d4bef4deb09553665503e86ece992f21c581fc9",
      "english": "[ctrl:FFA2]That's not the point!",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0002E784",
      "source_words_sha256": "03c843e99e706ac74cf42e66117fc1497180af6f1497d94d84e1f6a7553a6c5f",
      "english": "[ctrl:FFA2]A grown man\nlooking forward to\ndrama reruns?!",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0002E7C0",
      "source_words_sha256": "ea43b1fd96f93cb16460d33463673b1ad436aff8b4573568dd0e6bda5ded2ea0",
      "english": "[ctrl:FFA2]Hey!\nEnough already!",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0002E7EC",
      "source_words_sha256": "8ecb839004d36342dd366950afb34d051cfef44230d7f3dad22e197b8b6c56e1",
      "english": "[ctrl:FFA2]Why am I\non dinner duty?!\f[ctrl:FFA2]Actually,\nthere IS no dinner.",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0002E838",
      "source_words_sha256": "94c472fd3c4caec2611938d4c376f20c737823d6202bf17f8b345b6ce9a90ad3",
      "english": "[ctrl:FFA2]You know why...\nWe're broke.",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0002E868",
      "source_words_sha256": "d13da134b4191a7f1ed03459e64b6680615a6dc70ce579660b28eef4277a6ddf",
      "english": "[ctrl:FFA2]No jobs!\nBecause you won't work!",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0002E89C",
      "source_words_sha256": "429864a52ff36ca6cea892dfc467f1dccfd9ebd8bc93837af70e543039f9a2cb",
      "english": "[ctrl:FFA2]Time to hunt Gin Tama?\nThen go WORK!",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0002E8CC",
      "source_words_sha256": "e02e2cdbb89ede3e77b73221a4afa4ee72095c1857320065f4f95308ff871e52",
      "english": "[ctrl:FFA3]Maybe it's the animal-control\nstaff who got eaten...\f[ctrl:FFA3]So, what now?",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0002E91C",
      "source_words_sha256": "81d4513bcfed57abb34d76125bcaa2b95fcde1c405243d1bbec41180719a51c0",
      "english": "[ctrl:FFA3]Dinner.",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0002E92C",
      "source_words_sha256": "2a7ccdddba2e0bea75916cc15eb69fed4c0c2f98c212ba572678cb79014e2f4e",
      "english": "[ctrl:FFA3]Why not ask her\nfor a job lead?",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0002E958",
      "source_words_sha256": "f9a99fcc5025a5392892001ec888b7e9cf864d3962773a90ac7923aa55f3cf28",
      "english": "[ctrl:FFA3]So obvious.",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0002E970",
      "source_words_sha256": "97ecf697e55bcb772dc7dabeb2b9d9fa427348a297363c4dc4def4ca3c85d860",
      "english": "[ctrl:FFA2]Nobody said that!",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0002E994",
      "source_words_sha256": "2e63c850b18e7eb028c3eae01bb893a9cb7b635b3211f71a392de3b841921ab8",
      "english": "[ctrl:FFA1]Huh?!\n[ctrl:FFA2]We're really going?!",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0002E9FC",
      "source_words_sha256": "495c97500c714de664f6d94e58ddb2cac97e5a12b3abdadc76ba4239548b9ae6",
      "english": "Yes... A sanctuary\nfor old guys.\nI get it. Yes...",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0002ED04",
      "source_words_sha256": "15e8d5fed051744a53b96718b79a8a9e0c28f3c88bfbe5ad0bcd4204829bde34",
      "english": "Idiot. Does that\nfill our stomachs?",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0002EE38",
      "source_words_sha256": "6ef0b00c82d3313b35a07398900ac92ec5569dcccd63bc11bc7f817c6ab3c8b8",
      "english": "Swipe the rare Dragon Tama.\nWe'll be rich.",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0002EE68",
      "source_words_sha256": "c042907ea86337f3a9d57e23385c50cd6a70f792025ebdb1899f2c41a5d7fdda",
      "english": "Give back to society...\nAfter our luxuries.",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0002EEA0",
      "source_words_sha256": "19626546ec4d86fa7668cefb6d2675bc5fa229cb73f09c38d0cc5f2e1cb1f7be",
      "english": "Yes! Nezumi Kozo!\nAlways admired him!\nWanna be Nezumi Kozo!",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0002EEEC",
      "source_words_sha256": "914154b02aa6d31db377b4f1ede278267aacc465a1d2a068dbca18fd88ec4c94",
      "english": "Think, Shinpachi.\fEven if he's caught...\fSeized Gin Tama\nwill go to waste.\fPeople won't\nget any back.\fJust fill shogunate\nor Amanto pockets.",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0002F014",
      "source_words_sha256": "5fc6e30096373e074d8dcf31463d5b6df04d3beabf4740b764cc13f418605660",
      "english": "You're my assistant, right?\fHelp Nezumi Kozo\nlike a good assistant.",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0002F1B4",
      "source_words_sha256": "9a4151457008e87d7221275240edd2d5c4e88b38829679da795633070fd4f368",
      "english": "What? A dark broker?\nDid a circuit breaker trip?",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0002F20C",
      "source_words_sha256": "e93f1a3cd425820c687b5b386bba3fa01b3dad4ef8d2eb652b28131d4716836b",
      "english": "Crooks always\nthink the same way.\fBuy cheap,\nor threaten and steal!",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0002F340",
      "source_words_sha256": "285461d5c5a80e8228164b20fb64bff5fd29c0bd9f453862c7f775a4126f96f7",
      "english": "Nezumi Kozo, yes!",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0002F358",
      "source_words_sha256": "ddc987e0f69f0c4fc9959896c1b48d663be03556dd1d26af1ab776a3e5781f41",
      "english": "Brilliant! Gin's an idiot,\nbut he's smart!",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0002F380",
      "source_words_sha256": "2fe595721c13978b12a0f5f7716eccf7fab5a30b35e2e48b6ce1697f0ca5aa21",
      "english": "That's Nezumi Kozo\nfor you. Yep!",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0002F3F8",
      "source_words_sha256": "b5cb15d134e653cf713c2627002296cf9a5aef5e74b3ad62fd0b282fc53a96ae",
      "english": "Your motives\nare SO obvious!",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0002F524",
      "source_words_sha256": "8316735ab0bd11d525d4ea1b5652febf4dd285f1d37bda7943a7887df803919a",
      "english": "Even those Gin Tama...\fAre no exception.",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0002F5E0",
      "source_words_sha256": "de8227a2dffab21d78bef5f7ef2e16a7c4783784eddd6fb8e884cc83f14b0dcc",
      "english": "Someone's exploiting\nthat murky supply chain.",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0002F634",
      "source_words_sha256": "21e696ac632c7269a08e42b7b46491173a0b6c99c05844f6d8614e8b00dc55e9",
      "english": "Probably.\nTrading Gin Tama is legal,\neven at insane prices.",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0002F988",
      "source_words_sha256": "575a73fee17a56fbca3f26c3f7e7e39a58742b21b9b10dcc2157197a35fcca8a",
      "english": "Liar!! Nezumi Kozo?!\nYou just thought\nof that now!!",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0002FADC",
      "source_words_sha256": "f310ab642e00596e89b5dd1f7fbd954ebeb61694941da964888850480ac229cc",
      "english": "Who made ME\nNezumi Kozo's assistant?!",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0002FB74",
      "source_words_sha256": "b768116523baee0ebea430ac0e16a618e1265543ff690e257935e190c8d64a42",
      "english": "I win, Shinpachi.\fWant strength? Eat sugar.",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0002FC00",
      "source_words_sha256": "db147a48792ab3b4fcfa57a00a353a50f0bba68f351eb594e86259f6cd786d07",
      "english": "You promised.\fIf I won, you'd be\nNezumi Kozo's assistant.",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0002FC44",
      "source_words_sha256": "47235eb174662ac9dece0a8b967a49e420ac8e086be6b0de9c49c42bdb19c954",
      "english": "Shinpachi's in\nNezumi Kozo's gang.",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0002FEE0",
      "source_words_sha256": "0bd6db9dc2b4d3f5a66658a69b066bc8173a98d79e448aa65051bf27c6b02de8",
      "english": "It's settled! We'll be rich!",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0002FF00",
      "source_words_sha256": "7687c5ef98b28b1e32e70290913d37986aee5563f120a908fff39539aeeba567",
      "english": "Let's find that broker!",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0002FF24",
      "source_words_sha256": "6cb43fa02dc46f407f94d7085535f58bb08f82396cbfe7ed86a3e5e4dce1aeb3",
      "english": "Full bellies every day!",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0002FF40",
      "source_words_sha256": "9e11c9be8914eaa45f0d7687e941b42d15fe7b83a96e50f1aa9f2fb56a1e93ce",
      "english": "Give a gift, get\na thank-you date, yes?",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0002FF90",
      "source_words_sha256": "c165c0d390dc2e104085ca9a38b97785581a591f2eb51e87b2a9668ae71228c6",
      "english": "Get-rich-quick Tama!",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0003007C",
      "source_words_sha256": "2c11744dc608b25425173eadbf0faad6c40e62ff155afa90076cbe1fab8ea934",
      "english": "Jackpot!",
      "translator_note": null
    }
  ]
}
